# .env.example — variable-name documentation for collaborators. NEVER put real values here.
#
# To run this repo with your own credentials: copy to a gitignored `.env` and fill in YOUR values
# (or point your own secret manager at these names). Internally, secrets are delivered per surface
# and you never edit `.env` by hand:
#   local        chezmoi -> launchctl cache (biometric `op`)
#   Claude cloud SessionStart op inject -> $CLAUDE_ENV_FILE
#   GitHub CI    op inject via sa-ci (1Password CLI)
#
# List each variable a clone needs and where to obtain it (name only, no values):
#   EXAMPLE_API_TOKEN=     # what it is / where to get it
